  <p class="note">
    Revised September 2026. The benchmark figures in the original version of
    this post came from an earlier build of AEGIS and were not reproducible.
    The harness has since been rebuilt; this version argues from the current
    numbers, which are. Lesson 4 changed the most — and got better for it.
